<title>USA: New York Bagel Q3 pro forma net up.</title>
<headline>New York Bagel Q3 pro forma net up.</headline>
<dateline>WICHITA, Kan. 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr pro forma	   $ 0.04pro forma	$ 0.03</p>
<p> Net pro forma		133pro forma	    90</p>
<p> Revs			 2,900		    1,800</p>
<p>			9 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr pro forma	    $0.14pro forma	 $0.11</p>
<p> Net pro forma		444pro forma	   317</p>
<p> Revs			 8,100		    5,300</p>
<p>	 (All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Earnings are pro forma and reflect what net income would have been if the company had not operated as an S corporation. New York Bagel completed its initial public offering on August 26, 1996.</p>
<p>1996 Q3 net includes a one-time deferred tax charge of $74,000. With this deferred tax charge, net earnings totaled $59,000 or $0.02/shr.</p>
<p>Full name is New York Bagel Enterprises Inc.</p>
<p>-- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
